WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.000 line:85%
Evening. Anika, an international student, is cooking.

2
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.600 line:85%
Her phone sounds. An Earthquake Early Warning!

3
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.500 line:85%
Move away from the stove and get under the table.

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.500 line:85%
Drop, cover, hold on. Grip the table leg.

5
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.800 line:85%
Things are falling. Stay put until the shaking stops.

6
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.200 line:85%
The shaking has stopped. Now turn off the stove.

7
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.000 line:85%
Open the door to keep your exit clear.

8
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.500 line:85%
Broken glass on the floor. Always put on shoes.

9
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.000 line:85%
Take your emergency bag and go out.

10
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.000 line:85%
Do not use the elevator.

11
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.800 line:85%
Walk down the stairs calmly.

12
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.400 line:85%
Walk to the nearest evacuation site, the park.

13
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.600 line:85%
Tell your family: "I am safe."

14
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.000 line:85%
SafeGuard Japan — Be prepared, worry less

